    "For the croquettes: 500g home-made bread crumbs,",
    "For the croquettes: 200g flour (for coating),",
    "For the croquettes: 3 whisked eggs (for coating),",
    "For the croquettes: Mixed salad leaves and fresh herbs eg. dill, chives, fennel."
